1
00:01:48,170 --> 00:01:49,960
We did it!

2
00:01:50,328 --> 00:01:53,009
Heh, tumbling like a 
pinwheel! Stupid puppet!

3
00:01:54,729 --> 00:01:57,917
Shut the hell up, you orphan puppet! Yeah!

4
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,975
Yay! Yay!

5
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,800
Orphan puppet! Orphan puppet!

6
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,289
Yay! Yay!

7
00:02:03,056 --> 00:02:06,080
Shut up! I <i>do</i> have a grandpa!

8
00:02:06,549 --> 00:02:08,847
As if an old man could give 
birth to a wooden puppet!

9
00:02:08,993 --> 00:02:10,680
Yeah, that's right!

10
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:12,438
I'm Grandpa's boy!

11
00:02:12,517 --> 00:02:14,737
Yay! Orphan puppet! Yay!

12
00:02:14,849 --> 00:02:15,380
Ouch!

13
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:16,560
Why, you...!

14
00:02:27,367 --> 00:02:30,289
Help! Help me!

15
00:02:32,601 --> 00:02:33,765
Cole!

16
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,702
Help!

17
00:02:34,771 --> 00:02:36,771
Someone go get help!

18
00:02:39,177 --> 00:02:40,880


19
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:47,080
<i>Heh, well look at that!</i>

20
00:02:50,539 --> 00:02:54,645
Mokku, why don't you help him, huh? Mokku—

21
00:02:54,865 --> 00:02:58,140
Shut up! It's his fault! What do I care?!

22
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:01,320
Mokku, you'll never become 
human acting like that!

23
00:03:01,945 --> 00:03:02,945
Human?

24
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:06,200
That's right. What will happen 
if you don't save him?

25
00:03:06,315 --> 00:03:08,450
There's no one else who can swim!

26
00:03:15,708 --> 00:03:17,599
Help!

27
00:03:24,690 --> 00:03:25,690
Ah, Mokku!

28
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,140
Mokku!

29
00:03:35,411 --> 00:03:36,240
What's wrong?!

30
00:03:36,944 --> 00:03:39,761
Hey, hurry up and save him, Mokku!

31
00:04:18,216 --> 00:04:18,974
Cole!

32
00:04:22,294 --> 00:04:23,420
Cole.

33
00:04:23,592 --> 00:04:25,760
Why did you leave me behind...?

34
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:27,957
Sleep peacefully, my sweet boy...

35
00:04:27,981 --> 00:04:30,921
May heaven grant you rest 
as we lay you to peace.

36
00:05:00,610 --> 00:05:04,080
It wasn't me. He's the one 
to blame for doing that first.

37
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:08,080
It's not my fault! 
He's the one who fell in.

38
00:05:19,290 --> 00:05:22,880
Cheer up. Don't be so down.

39
00:05:35,599 --> 00:05:38,039
So it's really not my fault?

40
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,080
But...

41
00:05:44,650 --> 00:05:46,840
That's right, Mokku. Come on, Mokku.

42
00:05:47,255 --> 00:05:48,860
There's no need to brood over it.

43
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:52,892
That boy Cole fell into the river 
because the bridge was broken.

44
00:05:53,165 --> 00:05:57,605
You bravely jumped into the river to 
save him when no one else could.

45
00:05:57,780 --> 00:06:00,997
Of course I did. Huh? 
It doesn't bother me at all.

46
00:06:01,030 --> 00:06:04,360
Then let's hurry home. 
Grandpa is worried about you.

47
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:11,472
Why are you still moping around? It wasn't 
your fault. Brooding won't change anything.

48
00:06:11,820 --> 00:06:12,820
Shut up!

49
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,230
Stop putting on a tough act.

50
00:06:18,254 --> 00:06:20,971
You play pranks, but deep down, 
Mokku is a kind-hearted boy.

51
00:06:21,030 --> 00:06:23,100
Stop it! Go away!

52
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:47,938
Hey, Mokku, what are you trying to do?

53
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:52,356
I'm going to take Cole's place.

54
00:06:52,380 --> 00:06:54,404
Huh? What did you say?

55
00:06:55,530 --> 00:06:59,258
If I become Cole, even
Cole's mother will be happy.

56
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:04,680
Don't be foolish. It's not that easy 
to become someone else's child.

57
00:07:04,975 --> 00:07:09,324
Look, I know. But this 
way I'll have a mama too...

58
00:07:09,349 --> 00:07:12,300
...and maybe I could even become human!

59
00:07:13,165 --> 00:07:17,821
Good grief. Why do you 
always think only of yourself?

60
00:07:18,210 --> 00:07:21,949
Shut up! You nag and complain 
way too much anyway!

61
00:07:27,340 --> 00:07:32,300
What an idiot. He's only going to 
cause Cole's mother more grief.

62
00:07:33,409 --> 00:07:34,753
Goodbye!

63
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,962
I'm home, mama.

64
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,000
Welcome home.

65
00:07:58,297 --> 00:07:59,281
Cole...

66
00:08:41,924 --> 00:08:42,776
Cole?

67
00:08:44,893 --> 00:08:49,348
I'm such a fool... As if Cole 
would ever come home.

68
00:08:53,143 --> 00:08:54,143
Who's there?

69
00:08:59,989 --> 00:09:02,119
Oh... Who are you?

70
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:04,833
I'm Mokku.

71
00:09:05,039 --> 00:09:06,900
I was swept down the river with Cole.

72
00:09:08,910 --> 00:09:14,540
I, um... thought I could take Cole's 
place and comfort you, miss... Here.

73
00:09:15,460 --> 00:09:18,520
Get out! I don't ever want 
to see your face!

74
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:19,920
Miss!

75
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:21,820
Get out!

76
00:09:22,935 --> 00:09:24,120
I know the truth!

77
00:09:24,625 --> 00:09:26,198
If you hadn't thrown that stone...

78
00:09:26,222 --> 00:09:29,094
...Cole wouldn't have slipped 
and fallen into the river!

79
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,100
Get out of here right now!

80
00:09:32,729 --> 00:09:34,620
Or else I'll turn you into firewood 
and throw you in the stove!

81
00:09:35,069 --> 00:09:37,301
You should have died instead of Cole!

82
00:09:37,670 --> 00:09:38,974
You're nothing but a puppet!

83
00:10:04,070 --> 00:10:07,461
Oh, it started raining. How nice.

84
00:11:11,603 --> 00:11:12,623
Miss!

85
00:11:18,199 --> 00:11:22,760
Mokku, where are you? 
Where did he go in all this rain?

86
00:11:28,855 --> 00:11:30,160
Mokku...

87
00:11:46,759 --> 00:11:48,458
He must have gone home.

88
00:11:48,864 --> 00:11:53,697
I'm a grown woman acting so stupidly. 
I was so cruel to that poor kid.

89
00:12:03,989 --> 00:12:05,243
In a place like this...

90
00:12:11,249 --> 00:12:13,100
What a silly boy...

91
00:12:39,039 --> 00:12:42,080
Are you awake? Here, your lunch is ready.

92
00:12:45,839 --> 00:12:47,900
Wash your face and put this on.

93
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:50,560
I think it will fit you perfectly.

94
00:12:52,839 --> 00:12:56,040
What's the matter? Hurry up 
or you'll be late for school.

95
00:12:56,843 --> 00:13:00,217
M-Miss, are you forgiving me?

96
00:13:04,780 --> 00:13:09,920
Thank you, Miss! I'll be a good boy, 
I promise! I really promise!

97
00:13:21,319 --> 00:13:22,916
Whoa, incredible!

98
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:25,152
This is awesome!

99
00:13:25,519 --> 00:13:29,653
Hey, Mokku! You can't even taste
anything anyway, can you? Let me eat it!

100
00:13:29,755 --> 00:13:31,249
Let's trade lunches!

101
00:13:31,325 --> 00:13:33,560
Looks so good. Let me have some too!

102
00:13:33,680 --> 00:13:36,835
No way! Like I'd ever give any to you guys!

103
00:13:37,095 --> 00:13:38,095
Hand it over!

104
00:13:38,127 --> 00:13:38,738
Like hell I will!

105
00:13:38,930 --> 00:13:40,398
Whoops, take that!

106
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,820
Why, you little...!

107
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:46,280
Ow!

108
00:13:59,985 --> 00:14:01,560
Now then...

109
00:14:04,499 --> 00:14:05,499
Welcome home, Cole.

110
00:14:12,349 --> 00:14:14,900
Oh my! What happened to your clothes?

111
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,104
You've been fighting, haven't you?

112
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:19,099
Cole loved mischief too...

113
00:14:19,123 --> 00:14:21,840
...but he was never bad enough to 
tear his clothes to shreds like this.

114
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:26,880
Oh well.

115
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,248
By the way, did you enjoy your lunch?

116
00:14:29,708 --> 00:14:31,255
Yeah.

117
00:14:31,690 --> 00:14:34,600
I'm glad. Now, give me the basket.

118
00:14:36,365 --> 00:14:39,346
What's wrong? Come on, give it here.

119
00:14:42,514 --> 00:14:43,381
Here.

120
00:14:45,369 --> 00:14:50,360
I'm sorry. Everyone tried 
to take my lunch, so...

121
00:14:50,759 --> 00:14:53,880
You ruin everything that 
belonged to Cole, don't you?

122
00:15:00,289 --> 00:15:05,560
Eat up. They're all Cole's favorites.

123
00:15:10,779 --> 00:15:15,020
Mokku, what would you like on 
your bread? Cole loved jam.

124
00:15:15,625 --> 00:15:18,320
He'd take huge bites, too.

125
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:22,880
Here, I spread plenty of jam 
on it, just like Cole liked.

126
00:15:26,949 --> 00:15:29,360
What's wrong? You're a strange boy.

127
00:15:32,832 --> 00:15:33,832
Mokku!

128
00:15:34,799 --> 00:15:36,140
I don't want that stuff!

129
00:15:37,869 --> 00:15:41,505
Mokku, that is unacceptable! 
Cole was a much better boy.

130
00:15:42,467 --> 00:15:43,467
Stop it!

131
00:15:45,859 --> 00:15:47,434
Cole! Cole! Cole!

132
00:15:48,323 --> 00:15:49,694
I'm not Cole!

133
00:15:50,091 --> 00:15:51,940
I'm Mokku! My name is Mokku!

134
00:16:29,049 --> 00:16:31,640
Miss, I'm sorry about earlier.

135
00:16:33,590 --> 00:16:35,010
It's all right, Mokku.

136
00:16:35,034 --> 00:16:38,720
Please forgive me for
hurting your feelings.

137
00:16:38,745 --> 00:16:42,760
I'm truly grateful for your kind heart.

138
00:16:49,770 --> 00:16:52,618
Ah, it's getting late. Good night, Mokku.

139
00:17:03,399 --> 00:17:06,599
Mokku, where are you right now?

140
00:17:13,994 --> 00:17:15,059
Grandpa...

141
00:18:20,103 --> 00:18:21,572
You stupid fool!

142
00:18:21,635 --> 00:18:22,549
What are you going to do?!

143
00:18:25,752 --> 00:18:26,517
Mokku!

144
00:18:29,699 --> 00:18:34,180
I'm just a puppet anyway! 
I'm not a human child!

145
00:18:37,209 --> 00:18:40,747
Everyone's like that. 
Just because I'm a puppet...

146
00:18:40,772 --> 00:18:43,505
...with no mama, they treat 
me like I don't matter.

147
00:18:44,229 --> 00:18:45,733
Cole and Franco...

148
00:18:46,385 --> 00:18:49,960
But I want a mother, too!

149
00:18:50,198 --> 00:18:52,040
I want to be a human child!

150
00:19:07,459 --> 00:19:10,425
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

151
00:19:25,284 --> 00:19:26,574
Mokku...

152
00:19:27,332 --> 00:19:29,246
You understand what I 
told you now, don't you?

153
00:19:29,270 --> 00:19:33,460
If you stay here any longer, 
you'll only cause that lady more suffering.

154
00:19:33,999 --> 00:19:36,236
I don't want to hear your preaching.

155
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:41,600
Mokku, give it up. No matter how 
hard you try, you can't comfort her.

156
00:19:42,124 --> 00:19:44,420
So you're going back to your Grandpa.

157
00:19:46,529 --> 00:19:51,860
Mokku, please don't leave me. 
Don't leave me all alone.

158
00:19:54,429 --> 00:19:55,600
Mokku!

159
00:20:00,949 --> 00:20:02,415
Was it just a dream...

160
00:20:03,420 --> 00:20:05,490
Grandpa!

161
00:20:16,579 --> 00:20:19,073
Mokku! Mokku came back!

162
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:39,040
Grandpa!

163
00:20:40,420 --> 00:20:45,500
Grandpa, I'm sorry for not coming 
home. Are you mad at me, Grandpa?

164
00:20:47,515 --> 00:20:48,515
No.

165
00:20:50,580 --> 00:20:51,580
Really?

166
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:55,890
Truly. But I was very lonely.

167
00:20:56,008 --> 00:20:58,913
Still, I'm so glad. You have 
no idea how happy I am.

168
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:00,440
Grandpa.

169
00:21:04,789 --> 00:21:09,500
Forgive me. Because we're so 
poor, I can't even pack you a lunch.

170
00:21:09,794 --> 00:21:12,222
I'm a puppet, so I don't need to eat.

171
00:21:12,246 --> 00:21:14,240
Just being by your side is enough.

172
00:21:19,098 --> 00:21:20,098
I'm leaving now!

173
00:21:20,889 --> 00:21:22,545
Be careful out there.

174
00:21:32,919 --> 00:21:33,940
Mokku.

175
00:21:42,469 --> 00:21:45,480
Mokku, you must be angry 
with me for hitting you.

176
00:21:48,069 --> 00:21:52,000
I couldn't take Cole's 
place after all. I'm sorry.

177
00:21:56,749 --> 00:21:58,460
Here, this is your lunch.

178
00:21:59,765 --> 00:22:04,980
Thank you, Mokku. Thanks to you, I can
keep living without grieving forever.

179
00:22:05,459 --> 00:22:08,222
Really? Do you truly mean it?

180
00:22:10,339 --> 00:22:12,811
Promise me you won't be sad anymore.

181
00:22:13,300 --> 00:22:18,660
I promise. In exchange, Mokku, you 
must study hard and be a good boy.

182
00:22:20,119 --> 00:22:22,641
Yeah. And I'll become
human, just like Cole.

183
00:22:26,703 --> 00:22:27,703
Thank you.

184
00:22:28,464 --> 00:22:29,540
Mama.

185
00:22:32,499 --> 00:22:34,946
I've always wanted to 
call you that just once.

186
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:52,060
It's a promise, no more crying.

187
00:22:52,459 --> 00:22:54,181
See, even I'm—

188
00:23:02,731 --> 00:23:03,771
See?

189
00:23:07,889 --> 00:23:09,311
Goodbye, Mokku.

190
00:23:22,342 --> 00:23:24,170
Goodbye, Mama.

191
00:23:27,260 --> 00:23:28,260
Mama...

192
00:23:33,546 --> 00:23:36,232
Just as No-ra the stray cat said...

193
00:23:36,256 --> 00:23:39,887
...Mokku is tied to a cross to begin 
his training to become human.

194
00:23:40,600 --> 00:23:44,771
By the time he realizes it's a wicked 
scheme by Kenken and his gang...

195
00:23:44,795 --> 00:23:48,500
...it's too late, and the scorching sun 
leaves Mokku utterly exhausted.

196
00:23:49,529 --> 00:23:52,974
On top of that, battered by 
lightning and a great flood...

197
00:23:52,998 --> 00:23:56,040
...will Mokku have the strength 
left to survive this ordeal?

198
00:23:56,634 --> 00:23:59,360
Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku!

